WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.060
What do you personally think makes a team play better: high emotion, when you see players jumping around the sidelines, or calm execution?

2
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:19.120
I personally think the calm execution will sustain you throughout the game.

3
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:28.260
Emotion will carry you for a certain period of time, but after that, the readiness of your team,

4
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:35.420
the confidence of your team, the ability of your team will take over, if you’re ready to play.

5
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:41.640
The emotion will get you there, I think for a particular time, but that wears off.

6
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:50.540
And it’s the game plan, it’s the talent on your team, and it’s just the poise that makes the difference in the long run.
